type: software
title: "trundlr: task and resource scheduling for computational research"
abstract: >-
  A lightweight task and resource management application with timeline and
  calendar views and capacity/utilisation tracking, managing projects, tasks
  and a mixed pool of resources (human, CPU and GPU).
